      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 5,
      "content": "The following ADTs are approved transfer pathways for this major: AA-T Child and Adolescent Development AS-T Early Childhood Education AA-T Elementary Teacher Education AA-T Psychology AA-T Social Work and Human Services AA-T Sociology Visit SF State ADT Pathways and Roadmaps for a list of all approved ADT pathways for SF State degree programs and to view sample post-transfer advising roadmaps for each pathway. Students preparing to transfer into this major at SF State should complete any available articulated courses in the Requirement section(s) below. Completion of the American Institutions requirement (US-1, US-2, US-3) before transfer is also strongly recommended.",
      "contentHtml": "<p>The following ADTs are approved transfer pathways for this major:</p><p>AA-T Child and Adolescent Development</p><p>AS-T Early Childhood Education</p><p>AA-T Elementary Teacher Education</p><p>AA-T Psychology</p><p>AA-T Social Work and Human Services</p><p>AA-T Sociology</p><p><br></p><p>Visit <a href=\"https://ueap.sfsu.edu/2025-2026_ADT-pathways-roadmaps\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SF State ADT Pathways and Roadmaps</a> for a list of all approved ADT pathways for SF State degree programs and to view sample post-transfer advising roadmaps for each pathway.</p><p><br></p><p>Students preparing to transfer into this major at SF State should complete any available articulated courses in the Requirement section(s) below. Completion of the American Institutions requirement (US-1, US-2, US-3) before transfer is also strongly recommended.</p>"
